:: Fishing Seagull Shoo
<<effects>>
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	갈매기는 <span class="green">깜짝 놀라 물러서더니</span>, 바다 위로 날아간다.
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		아주 작은 물고기라, 통째로 입에 넣을 수 있을 것 같다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name + "【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Beach Wait]]>>
			<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Beach Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name + "【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
			<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Pier Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name + "【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>>
			<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Coast Path Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	발버둥 쳐 보았지만, 갈매기가 쏜살같이 날아와 손에서 물고기를 <span class="red">채어가며</span> 날아가 버린다.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Seagull Give
<<effects>>
<<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【을를】 내민다. 갈매기가 그것을 빤히 바라보더니, 손에서 채어가며 날아간다.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

/* =================================== */
/* ===== Minigame Result Widgets ===== */
/* =================================== */

:: Widgets Fishing Seagull Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingSeagullCatch">>
	<<set _fish to _args[0]>>
	<<set _fishingLocation to _args[1]>>
	<<set _fishNameKr to setup.foodstuff[_fish.type].name>>
	<<effects>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.seagullSteal to true>>

	<<if _fish.size gte 120>>
		갈매기 한 마리가 머리 위를 빙빙 돌다 <<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 발견하고는 당신 곁으로 내려앉는다. 녀석은 부리로 물고기를 꽉 물고 끌어당겨 본다. 꿈쩍도 하지 않는다. 갈매기는 온 힘을 다해 다시 한번 끌어당겨 보지만, 물고기는 여전히 요지부동이다. 녀석은 마지막으로 물고기를 한 번 쳐다보더니, 방금 일은 아예 없었던 일로 치기로 결심한 듯 뚱한 걸음걸이로 뒤뚱거리며 떠나간다.
		<br><br>

		<<if _fishingLocation is "fishingBeach">>
			<<link [["<<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Beach Wait]]>>
				<<tending_give _fish.type 1>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingPier">>
			<<link [["<<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
				<<tending_give _fish.type 1>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingCoastPath">>
			<<link [["<<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 챙겨둔다"|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>>
				<<tending_give _fish.type 1>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		갈매기 한 마리가 근처에 내려앉아 당신의 <<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 주시한다. 잠시 뒤 껑충 다가와 당신의 잡은 물고기를 향해 덤벼든다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[쫓아낸다|Fishing Seagull Shoo]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty -100 200>>
		<br>
		<<link [[<<= _fishNameKr>>【을를】 넘겨준다|Fishing Seagull Give]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
